## How downstream skills query this graph
Pass `--graph docs/discovery/<SERVICE>/graphify-out/graph.json` to:
- `graphify query "<question>" [--budget N] [--context call]` — neighborhood around a topic
- `graphify explain "<node>"` — one node's source, cluster, relationships
- `graphify path "<src>" "<tgt>" [--directed|--undirected]` — shortest relationship path
- `graphify affected "<node>"` — dependent impact / blast radius

## Evidence note
graphify returns graph **context**, not a verified answer. A returned relation + source ref is
`observed`; a missing path or empty `affected` set is `inferred` (static structure only — dynamic
wiring such as DI / dynamic dispatch may be absent). If the graph was not built, downstream skills
read source directly and mark findings `inferred`.
